## UI conventions (production)

- Admin forms: `db-input`, `FormSelect` / `SearchableSelect`; dates use native `input type="date"` (browser / phone calendar). No Tailwind `bg-blue-600` one-offs.
- Cascade dropdowns: always include empty option (`withEmptyOption` from `shared/select-options.ts`) e.g. "All campuses".
- Primary actions: `db-wf-btn db-wf-btn--primary` or `db-submit`; archive: `erp-confirm-danger` / `db-archive-summary`.
- Toasts on every user action (5s timeline).

Live DB may differ from seed after manual edits — APIs are authoritative at runtime.
